"{\n \"url\": \"https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/Interaction-System-Breakdown-3b27216d8bc5809488c9ec5730e93098\",\n \"text\": \"Skip to content\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-borne Prototype\\n/\\nSystems Documentation\\n/\\nInteraction System Breakdown\\nGet Notion free\\nInteraction System Breakdown\\n4 more properties\\nOverview\\n\\nThe interaction system is built as a modular, extensible framework that allows the player to interact with a wide range of world objects—from simple pickups to complex inspectable items and actionable environment elements such as doors and chests. The system is designed to be lightweight, data‑driven, and easy to expand without modifying core logic.\\n\\nAt its core, the system uses a unified interaction interface that all interactable objects implement. When the player enters an interaction zone or targets an object, the system checks for this interface and determines the appropriate interaction type. This allows the same player logic to support multiple categories of interactions while keeping object‑specific behavior isolated and clean.\\nAnimation for opening doors and chest as well as ladder climbing will be implemented soon! I swear!!\\nWorld Interaction\\nA showcase of player Interacting with different type of objects within the world\\nPicking Up Items\\nOpening Doors\\nOpening Locked Doors\\nThe Door requests an item labeled under a specified tag to be present within players inventory in order to be operated\\nInspecting A Note\\nOpening A Chest\\nChests can be locked as doors and require certain items to open. In future implementation some chest might require other conditions to unlock such as currency\\nPlayer Interaction depending on his state\\nAs has been showcased in the combat breakdown section, player can equip different types of weapons which changes his state. Along with that his pickup animations adapt with the change. depending on the equipped item and items elevation, different animations will be played. Currently this is supported only for picking up items.\\nPlayer Item Pickup While Equipped With Heavy Weapon\\nUsing Items\\nCurrently item usability is not supported by the GAS system within my project. I will  implement it down the line\\nOverall, the interaction system provides a flexible foundation for world interactivity, supporting both simple and complex objects while maintaining clarity, modularity, and ease of expansion.\\nShare site\\nInteraction System Break…\\nGet Notion free\\nInteraction System Break…\\nOverview\\nWorld Interaction\\nPlayer Interaction depending on his state\\nUsing Items\\nOverall, the interaction system provides a flexible foundation for world interactivity, supporting both simple and complex objects while maintaining clarity, modularity, and ease of expansion.\\nCopy URL\\nSign up or log in\\nReport page\\nCookie settings\\nStrictly necessary\\nEssential for the site to function. Always On.\\nFunctional\\nUsed to remember preference selections and provide enhanced features.\\nAnalytics\\nUsed to measure usage and improve your experience.\\nMarketing\\nUsed for targeted advertising.\",\n \"media\": [\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/icons/laptop_gray.svg?mode=dark\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A5d8dad64-cd53-40a0-aa8a-4f8f9e1d4acb%3ADark_Souls_Remastered_Standard_Edition_Product_Banner__79471.jpg?table=block&id=3b27216d-8bc5-8094-88c9-ec5730e93098&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1860&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://file.notion.so/f/f/9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9/a628025b-4ab8-450a-a6ef-6ea74ba5cf22/PrayForPlagues_Pickup-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?table=block&id=3b27216d-8bc5-809e-8279-d4c2697df963&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&expirationTimestamp=1786896000000&signature=mRiHDVPvNqX9osGojhWJXPRdJ1hoLNWrrDIrDwqUrS0\",\n  \"IMG: https://file.notion.so/f/f/9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9/e